View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Holy crap, this entire thread is <i>amazing</i>!<br /> <br /> Is it okay if I link to your excellent homebrew in a sidebar of my Detroit setting, <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1aKXIs06-OWkbk1twylKtEEjAeug0LpPkP4z9jBBJyZY/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Motor City Breakdown</a>? Southeast Michigan is home to the world's largest population of Arabs outside the Middle East, so it's almost inevitable that anyone who fools around in the enclave of Hamtramck or the suburb of Dearborn long enough will run into a <i>djinni</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, go for it. The only thing that's better than people liking my stuff is them using it for their own shenanigans, be it games or homebrew.<br /> <br /> And thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-04T12:53:10-07:00","id":1124900,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath